monolith
========

Minimal monochrome rice for Fedora + Hyprland.
Pure black backgrounds, grayscale palette, sharp edges.


THEME
-----

Colors:     Pure monochrome (black, white, grays)
Font:       JetBrainsMono Nerd Font
Style:      Sharp edges, minimal spacing, zero radius corners
Background: Pure black (#000000)


COMPONENTS
----------

Window Manager:   Hyprland
Bar:              Waybar
Notifications:    Mako
Launcher:         Vicinae
Terminal:         Wezterm
Shell:            Fish
Editor:           Neovim (Kanagawa Dragon)
Screenshots:      Flameshot


INSTALLATION
------------

This repository uses GNU Stow for symlink management.

Install Stow:

    sudo dnf install stow

Clone and deploy:

    git clone git@github.com:0x-kys/dots ~/dev/rndm/dots
    cd ~/dev/rndm/dots
    git checkout monolith

Install all packages:

    stow -t ~ hyprland waybar mako nvim fish kitty wezterm opencode

Or use the install script:

    ./install.sh

Uninstall:

    cd ~/dev/rndm/dots
    stow -D -t ~ hyprland waybar mako nvim fish kitty wezterm opencode


STRUCTURE
---------

    dots/
    ├── hyprland/     Hyprland compositor config
    ├── waybar/       Status bar config and scripts
    ├── mako/         Notification daemon config
    ├── nvim/         Neovim editor config
    ├── fish/         Fish shell config
    ├── kitty/        Kitty terminal config
    ├── wezterm/      Wezterm terminal config
    └── opencode/     OpenCode agent configurations

Each package contains a .config/ subdirectory mirroring ~/.config/.


FEATURES
--------

Waybar:
  - Pure black monochrome theme
  - System monitoring (CPU, RAM, GPU, temperature)
  - MPRIS media controls
  - DND toggle for notifications
  - Network status, audio controls, system tray

Hyprland:
  - Minimal gaps (4px inner, 8px outer)
  - Sharp borders (zero radius)
  - Thin 1px borders (light gray active, dark gray inactive)
  - Fast, snappy animations
  - No automatic sleep or screen blanking

Wezterm:
  - Custom monochrome colorscheme
  - Pure grayscale ANSI palette
  - No colors, only blacks/whites/grays
  - 80% opacity for subtle transparency

Notifications:
  - Mako with pure black background
  - Monochrome styling
  - DND mode accessible from Waybar


KEYBINDS
--------

Super + Return      Open terminal
Super + Space       Launch Vicinae
Super + Q           Close window
Super + F           Toggle floating
Print               Screenshot (Flameshot)


WORKFLOW
--------

All configs are symlinked. Changes made in ~/.config/ automatically
update the repository.

To save changes:

    cd ~/dev/rndm/dots
    git add -A
    git commit -m "description of changes"
    git push origin monolith


NOTES
-----

- Configs use GNU Stow for symlink management
- Background is pure black (#000000) across all applications
- ANSI colors in terminal are grayscale only
- No rounded corners anywhere in the system
- Minimal spacing and padding throughout


